Description: 
  The main objective of the *CommuteCA* package is to develop standardized methods for
  accessibility analysis in research, especially for studies using the 2021 Census of Population of Statistics Canada,
  which contain valuable variables for transportation research. This package was
  created with support from the office of the Research Data Center at McMaster University,
  the Sherman Centre for Digital Scholarship and Mobilizing Justice.
